 ## Unreleased — 1.4.0
 
-Nothing yet.
+### The usage ledger is per user, not per project
+
+`ingest` and `usage` now keep the ledger at `~/.smysl/usage.log` (`%USERPROFILE%` where `HOME`
+is unset), so `smysl usage` totals what a person has spent across every project instead of one
+checkout. Without a home directory it falls back to the project's `.smysl/usage.log`. A ledger
+already sitting in a project's `.smysl/` is no longer read; append it to the home one if the
+history matters. Adds `Ledger::user_path` and `Ledger::path_in_home`.
 
 ---
 
